                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Starts off alright but goes downhill the moment leave first house. 'Run blindly through forest looking for random object' game. Does advertise walking for hours, didn't expect it's because there are [b]zero[/b] checkpoints. Which might not be so bad if not for the invisible enemies and sound fx made in a toilet bowl. No real story to keep me interested. Basic quest-line that is unvoiced and directs to objectives. Couldn't find car key when standing on top of the dot so I decided to kill myself and call it a night. Might be worthwhile for achievement hunters, anyone else I'd recommend a pass. Cheers.\nhttps://youtu.be/1A5IfhNIue4",
